        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    modified_duration = 10.3829\n    modified_convexity = 141.217\n    yield_change = -0.005  # A 50 basis point fall\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    duration_effect = -modified_duration * yield_change\n    convexity_effect = 0.5 * modified_convexity * (yield_change ** 2)\n    percentage_price_change = (duration_effect + convexity_effect) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(percentage_price_change, 3)\n```",
